  "chapter": "第一章　有理分式",
  "section": "§3. 分母中含未知数的分式方程",
  "number": "9",
  "title": "分母中含有未知数的分式方程的解法",
  "printed_title": "9. 分母中含有未知数的分式方程的解法",
  "start_page": 43,
  "start_printed": 37,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 16,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "假设需要解方程：\n$\\frac{6x}{3x+4}=\\frac{2x-1}{x}$。\n（1）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#6",
        "p0044#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "假设需要解方程：$\\frac{6x}{3x+4}=\\frac{2x-1}{x}$。 （1）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们可以应用分数等于零的条件。\n为此，将方程（1）写成：\n$\\frac{6x}{3x+4}-\\frac{2x-1}{x}=0$，\n\n再通分，得：\n$\\frac{6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)}{x(3x+4)}=0$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们可以应用分数等于零的条件。为此，将方程（1）写成：$\\frac{6x}{3x+4}-\\frac{2x-1}{x}=0$，再通分，得：$\\frac{6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)}{x(3x+4)}=0$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个方程和下列方程-不等式组同解：\n$\\begin{cases}6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)=0,\\\\ x(3x+4)\\ne0.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "这个方程和下列方程-不等式组同解：$\\begin{cases}6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)=0,\\\\  x(3x+4)\\ne0.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "先解其中的方程，再验证所得的根是否满足条件$x(3x+4)\\ne0$，就可得出方程（1）的解集合。\n$6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)=0$，\n$6x^2-6x^2+3x-8x+4=0$，\n\n$-5x=-4$，$x=0.8$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "先解其中的方程，再验证所得的根是否满足条件$x(3x+4)\\ne0$，就可得出方程（1）的解集合。$6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)=0$，$6x^2-6x^2+3x-8x+4=0$，$-5x=-4$，$x=0.8$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$0.8\\times(3\\times0.8+4)\\ne0$，\n这是真命题。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "$0.8\\times(3\\times0.8+4)\\ne0$，这是真命题。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：\n$\\{0.8\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "答： $\\{0.8\\}$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（1）也可以利用分母相同的分数相等的条件求解：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程（1）也可以利用分母相同的分数相等的条件求解：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**分数 $\\frac{a}{c}$ 和 $\\frac{b}{c}$（$a$，$b$ 和 $c$ 是有理数），当且仅当它们的分子相等，而且公分母不等于零时，这两个分数相等，即**$\\left(\\frac{a}{c}=\\frac{b}{c}\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow(a=b,\\ c\\ne0)$，其中 $a$，$b$，$c$ 是有理数。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#8",
        "p0045#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "**分数 $\\frac{a}{c}$ 和 $\\frac{b}{c}$（$a$，$b$ 和 $c$ 是有理数），当且仅当它们的分子****相等，而且公分母不等于零时，这两个分数相等，即**$\\left(\\frac{a}{c}=\\frac{b}{c}\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow(a=b,\\ c\\ne0)$，其中 $a$，$b$，$c$ 是有理数。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将分式 $\\frac{6x}{3x+4}$ 和 $\\frac{2x-1}{x}$ 通分，得：\n$\\frac{6x^2}{x(3x+4)}=\\frac{(2x-1)(3x+4)}{x(3x+4)}$。\n（2）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "将分式 $\\frac{6x}{3x+4}$ 和 $\\frac{2x-1}{x}$ 通分，得：$\\frac{6x^2}{x(3x+4)}=\\frac{(2x-1)(3x+4)}{x(3x+4)}$。 （2）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为分式的分母相同，所以当且仅当 $x$ 的值使得分子相等而分母不等于零时，这两个分式的值相等。\n因此，方程（2）以及方程（1）和下列方程-不等式组同解：\n$\\begin{cases}6x^2=(2x-1)(3x+4),\\\\ x(3x+4)\\ne0.\\end{cases}$解方程（1），得到解集合。\n\n有$6x^2=(2x-1)(3x+4)$，$6x^2=6x^2-3x+8x-4$，$-5x=-4$，$x=0.8$，$0.8\\times(3\\times0.8+4)\\ne0$，这是真命题。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为分式的分母相同，所以当且仅当 $x$ 的值使得分子相等而分母不等于零时，这两个分式的值相等。因此，方程（2）以及方程（1）和下列方程-不等式组同解：$\\begin{cases}6x^2=(2x-1)(3x+4),\\\\  x(3x+4)=0.\\end{cases}$解方程（1），得到解集合。有$6x^2=(2x-1)(3x+4)$，$6x^2=6x^2-3x+8x-4$，$-5x=-4$，$x=0.8$，$0.8\\times(3\\times0.8+4)\\ne0$，这是真命题。",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "math-correction"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：\n$\\{0.8\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "答： $\\{0.8\\}$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们再举一个例子。\n利用两个分式相等的条件解方程：\n$\\frac{y+1}{y-2}-\\frac{5}{y+2}=\\frac{12}{y^2-4}+1$。\n\n（3）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们再举一个例子。利用两个分式相等的条件解方程：$\\frac{y+1}{y-2}-\\frac{5}{y+2}=\\frac{12}{y^2-4}+1$。 （3）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为此，将 $\\frac{y+1}{y-2}$，$\\frac{5}{y+2}$，$\\frac{12}{y^2-4}$ 和 $1$ 都化成最简公分母的分式，并将方程两边写成：\n$\\frac{(y+1)(y+2)-5(y-2)}{(y-2)(y+2)}=\\frac{12+(y^2-4)}{(y-2)(y+2)}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "为此，将 $\\frac{y+1}{y-2}$，$\\frac{5}{y+2}$，$\\frac{12}{y^2-4}$ 和 $1$ 都化成最简公分母的分式，并将方程两边写成：$\\frac{(y+1)(y+2)-5(y-2)}{(y-2)(y+2)}=\\frac{12+(y^2-4)}{(y-2)(y+2)}$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个方程，也就是方程（3），和下列方程不等式组同解：\n$\\begin{cases}(y+1)(y+2)-5(y-2)=12+(y^2-4),\\\\ (y-2)(y+2)\\ne0.\\end{cases}$由此得出：\n$y^2+y+2y+2-5y+10=12+y^2-4$，\n$-2y=-4$，\n$y=2$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#7",
        "p0046#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "这个方程，也就是方程（3），和下列方程不等式组同解：$\\begin{cases}(y+1)(y+2)-5(y-2)=12+(y^2-4),\\\\  (y-2)(y+2)\\ne0.\\end{cases}$由此得出：$y^2+y+2y+2-5y+10=12+y^2-4$，$-2y=-4$，$y=2$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(2-2)(2+2)\\ne0$，\n这是假命题。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$(2-2)(2+2)\\ne0$，这是假命题。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程-不等式组无解。\n因此，方程（3）也无解。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程-不等式组无解。因此，方程（3）也无解。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：\n$\\varnothing$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "答： $\\varnothing$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
